  "prefLabel": "Env-Dw 504.01 Owner Liability",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 504.01 Owner Liability. The owner of a public water system (PWS) may delegate any responsibility imposed by this part to another person, subject to any limitations specified herein. Such delegation shall not relieve the owner from liability for non-compliance with these requirements.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at part heading for Env-Dw 504) #10465, eff 12-2-13; ss by #14006, eff 6-25-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-dw500.html"
